  "title": "V2X Congratulates Chief Growth Officer Roger Mason on Confirmation as Director of the National Reconnaissance Office",
  "summary": "RESTON, Va., Aug. 17, 2026 /PRNewswire/ — V2X, Inc. (NYSE: VVX), a leading provider of global mission solutions supporting defense, national security and civilian customers, congratulates Chief Growth Officer Dr. L. Roger Mason Jr. on his confirmation by the U.S. Senate to serve as Director of the National Reconnaissance Office. Since joining V2X in 2025, […]",
